WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.583
[UPBEAT MUSIC]

00:00:00.583 --> 00:00:02.910
We're just living
in a time where

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.190
AI is transforming everything.

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:08.280
It's transforming how we
work within disciplines,

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:11.520
like science, or climate
change, or medicine,

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.950
or all forms of technology.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.250
It's driving
economies worldwide.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.250
And in some cases, it's
leading to outcomes

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.760
that perhaps weren't
as intended, and not as

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:27.000
equitable and beneficial as
we would hope them to be.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.730
And this really powerful
disruptive technology,

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.920
there's a lot of
good an opportunity.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.600
But there's potential
for downside

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.970
that we have to just
be really mindful of.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:40.440
People are interacting
with and using AI every day

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.390
and they don't even know it.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:45.570
Like, YouTube is feeding
them up a next video.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:47.040
Why that video?

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:50.910
In my research, I know, because
I developed these systems.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:53.880
I developed these systems to
help people learn new things.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.950
I build systems that
help persuade people

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.570
to take healthier actions.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.580
These are technologies
that are influencing

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:04.629
the way we learn, our decisions,
our opinions, our behaviors.

00:01:04.629 --> 00:01:07.980
It is a technology
that people use.

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:11.100
It's our decisions is what's
causing it to be applied

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.170
in the way that it is, right?

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.960
So having people
just understand what

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:20.070
AI is, that it is a
tool for empowerment.

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:23.460
It also has the risk of
exacerbating inequality

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:24.690
if we're not careful, right?

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:28.050
So it's a change agent,
in a way, that people just

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:32.160
need to be much more
savvy and cognizant about,

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:36.814
so they can make intelligent
informed decisions.

00:01:36.814 --> 00:01:39.992
[UPBEAT MUSIC]

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:44.880
We created Raise, which is a
new MIT-wide initiative, that

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:47.640
stands for Responsible
AI for Social Empowerment

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.960
and Education.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:52.380
We're creating these
innovative curriculum that

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:56.220
introduce-- not only AI
concepts and technologies,

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.770
but responsible
design practices,

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:02.520
as well as societal implications
of these technologies, where

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:05.490
the students are placed as
the designer of these systems

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:06.450
in our approach.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:08.220
And we educate them
in these methods.

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:09.720
They build things with it.

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:12.270
They design things in groups.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:15.930
How do you make learning
experiences more high touch,

00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:17.835
more engaging, more
emotionally engaging?

00:02:17.835 --> 00:02:21.070
So being able to track the
learners emotional state,

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:22.410
their attentional state.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.830
Adapting the experience and
the content accordingly.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:29.640
Innovations around VR,
AR, immersive space,

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:32.430
it's just other
ways of inventing

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:36.570
how we can bring much more of
a face-to-face, interpersonal,

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:39.412
emotionally engaging experience
to learning at distance

00:02:39.412 --> 00:02:40.620
through digital technologies.

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:43.970
[UPBEAT MUSIC]

